Project Title: Smart Task Manager (Redux Edition)

Objective:
Build a complete Task Management Dashboard using:
    • React
    • Redux Toolkit
    • Async Thunk
    • Proper architecture

Mandatory Features:
    • Authentication System (Redux Managed)
    • Protected Routes
    • Task CRUD Operations
    • Filter by Status
    • Search Tasks
    • Loading & Error Handling
    • Optimized Rendering
    • Clean Folder Architecture
Technical Requirements:
Must use:
    • createSlice
    • configureStore
    • useSelector
    • useDispatch
    • createAsyncThunk
    • React.memo
    • Lazy Loading